WEBVTT

00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:01.440
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>have</b>

00:00:02.257 --> 00:00:03.741
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you have a pet?

00:00:04.598 --> 00:00:05.643
What is it?

00:00:06.627 --> 00:00:08.307
How long have you had it?

00:00:10.212 --> 00:00:11.801
<v><b>B:</b></v> Do you have a tablet?

00:00:12.762 --> 00:00:13.807
What kind?

00:00:14.777 --> 00:00:16.385
How long have you had it?

00:00:18.346 --> 00:00:19.106
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>live</b>

00:00:20.057 --> 00:00:22.012
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you live in a modern flat?

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.181
How old is it?

00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:26.684
How long have you lived there?

00:00:28.595 --> 00:00:30.371
<v><b>B:</b></v> Do you live near this school?

00:00:31.259 --> 00:00:32.459
Where exactly?

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:35.143
How long have you lived there?

00:00:37.120 --> 00:00:38.053
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>know</b>

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:41.382
<v><b>A:</b></v> Do you know anybody from another country?

00:00:42.343 --> 00:00:44.023
Where’s he or she from?

00:00:44.980 --> 00:00:47.504
How long have you known him or her?

00:00:49.477 --> 00:00:50.185
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> <b>be</b>

00:00:51.034 --> 00:00:53.049
<v><b>B:</b></v> Are you a fan of a football team?

00:00:54.025 --> 00:00:54.920
Which team?

00:00:55.869 --> 00:00:57.321
How long have you been a fan?

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:02.193
<v><b>A:</b></v> Are you a member of a club or organization?

00:01:03.153 --> 00:01:04.066
Which one?

00:01:05.171 --> 00:01:07.032
How long have you been a member?

00:01:09.142 --> 00:01:10.180
<v><b>B:</b></v> Are you married?

00:01:11.139 --> 00:01:12.793
What’s your partner’s name?

00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:15.306
How long have you been married?